    "title": "AniVAG 目标系统组件架构",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "viewBox": [1200, 650],
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "online_retrieval",
        "label": "在线名场面检索",
        "focus": [
          "web_client",
          "conversation_service",
          "retrieval_evidence_service",
          "hybrid_retrieval_pipeline",
          "gateway",
          "mysql",
          "qdrant",
          "video_management_service"
        ],
        "note": "追问先改写成独立检索请求，再执行 Query Embedding 与双路召回；Video Management 统一读取 Series 范围、活动索引版本、VideoChunk 元数据和播放证据。"
      },
      {
        "id": "offline_indexing",
        "label": "上传后异步解析与建库",
        "focus": [
          "web_client",
          "video_management_service",
          "durable_job_runtime",
          "video_parser_pipeline",
          "gateway",
          "vector_index_manager",
          "mysql",
          "qdrant",
          "artifact_store"
        ],
        "note": "分片上传并合并原视频后提交 ParseJob；上传请求不等待模型解析，前端持续读取持久化进度，后台完成解析、索引同步与发布。"
      },
      {
        "id": "consistency",
        "label": "MySQL–Qdrant 一致性",
        "focus": [
          "durable_job_runtime",
          "video_parser_pipeline",
          "vector_index_manager",
          "mysql",
          "qdrant"
        ],
        "note": "MySQL 是事实源；Qdrant 是派生索引，通过稳定 Point ID、版本/哈希、重试和 Reconciler 最终收敛。"
      }
    ]
  },
